# WARP-8: a held step on the kit: knob 1 its velocity, knob 2 its chance, knob 3 its ratchets (a multiply trick put
# on and taken off for you), knob 4 its nudge. SELECT turned while it is held: the others (length, pitch), and back
wait 300
listen
expect trk 1
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
expect drumhits 1
key w0 down
wait 100
turn K3 2
wait 500
said RATCHET
key w0 up
wait 40
expect ktrick1.1.1.1 3
# three hits in the step: a bar is three, not one
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tap PLAY
expect drumhits 4
# back to one: the trick goes
key w0 down
wait 100
turn K3 -2
wait 40
key w0 up
expect ktrick1.1.1.1 0
# the nudge on knob 4
key w0 down
wait 100
turn K4 3
wait 500
said NUDGE
# SELECT: the other knobs; knob 4 is the step's pitch there
turn SELECT 1
wait 40
turn K4 2
wait 500
said PITCH
shot ratchet_alt.png
key w0 up
wait 40
expect page Steps
